{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2c681a5d748961a059cd2f3ab97724fd03a3cdf4e2adb047a2ecaad1aafa1c70", "ja": "（クレシェンドブルーの結成から、一週間。\nそろそろユニットとして、形になってきたかな……）", "zh": "（「Crescendo Blue」成军后过了一周，\n作为一个团体，差不多该成形了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "e1d730317b64915302ca57712eff61ab4599d378b3cd2948ca57e95bb5076898", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー。\nワン、ツー、はぁ、はぁ……。", "zh": "1、2、3、4，\n1、2、呼……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "3ace33afd2376fb09d2fa8b6124266d4d0b653a5f99f65dcae6abe0ffe3cc493", "ja": "はぁ……っ……。", "zh": "呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "7809eade0bf8d8deee531bda4cc03f52bd43429b1ad3ca0fd5ed50945a128557", "ja": "星梨花、志保、大丈夫？\nすこし、休憩入れましょうか？", "zh": "星梨花、志保，还好吗？\n我们稍微休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "13a2164e774b7702e87049da7dcbba53da07db38d0eec7281497d27bd3edc8ac", "ja": "はあっ、はあっ……問題、ないわ。\n続けましょう。", "zh": "呼、呼……我没问题，\n继续练吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "a45cb8b9d92f8850732e553b9b384bc355cbc86439f5057caf02fa57196e3d7c", "ja": "でも……。", "zh": "可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "38969e840b8a999325dda81916064d3c9482559d29db5e3943ffbee5cc8d3e3b", "ja": "そうだな、無理に続けてもケガをしかねない。\nみんな、休憩にしよう。", "zh": "是啊，勉强继续练习说不定会受伤，\n大家先休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "5718e55f7c6ca7db68acb1ebfcc381d09522fa481b1d41296e55c51c6555ebb4", "ja": "大丈夫です、静香さん、{$P$}さん！\nわたし、まだまだ頑張れます！", "zh": "没事的，静香姊姊、{$P$}先生！\n我还可以继续努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "794ddb101db27edca743e5283faa59bccfea31594bd63a7228bb5cb56ad38103", "ja": "星梨花……。", "zh": "星梨花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "9de3eed59544cdb3956f274c1eb637492547d1aa68e7801999b9ea24040898b4", "ja": "え～っ？　茜ちゃんは疲れちゃったな～？\n星梨花ちゃん、休憩しようよ！　甘いモノでも食べて♪", "zh": "咦～？小茜倒是累了呢～\n星梨花，我们来休息吧！吃点甜的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "cbea68b16d741893a35eb1ea79ece385406855d23edc243426b089d7220234ee", "ja": "わー、素敵だね！\nでもでも茜ちゃん、甘いモノなんてどこにあるの？", "zh": "哇──好棒！\n但是但是小茜，哪里有甜点呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "84ad33887ac0fb2e2905fb37a5a0235a18be37ed0c81b5737a5a4e14bc0f3575", "ja": "もちろん、今すぐ買ってきてもらうんだよ！\nね、{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "当然是现在请人买过来呀！\n对不对，小{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_1012", "source_sha256": "dbbadeb471d936f3518c50b26ae4b35dc85b4e5506c2b5850336e46b6c1c0bad", "ja": "任せろ", "zh": "交给我", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2000_p", "source_sha256": "cc50cfc1d405448c28f46143ea4d8c03a3b38716e9f1928bd617b637eaef9914", "ja": "そう来ると思って、買っておいたぞ。\n冷蔵庫に入ってるから、みんなで食べるといい。", "zh": "我就猜到会这样，已经先买好了喔。\n甜点已经放在冰箱里了，大家一起吃吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2001_048rei", "source_sha256": "51d2783b23278d9cc12e0e4b8efca42f390032d3dcd9e48ed25e6254c2a788fa", "ja": "わ～いわ～い♪　ありがとうございます！\nあっ、プリンとケーキがある♪　素敵♪", "zh": "哇～哇～♪谢谢！\n啊，有布丁和蛋糕♪太棒了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2002_048rei", "source_sha256": "422f9d02836f7fd8abe49cc3ce37cd6b11caac796e6594263595a2c586149f0e", "ja": "今日の{$P$}さんには、\nプリンデューサーさんの称号をあげちゃいますね♪", "zh": "今天就颁给{$P$}先生\n布丁制作人先生的称号吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2003_023aka", "source_sha256": "e431ecb6640a7ab8a4efb6a7a9b839fcac905a32fd311218754aa62f1966a10e", "ja": "ぬぬっ、やるな{$P$}ちゃん！\nだが、茜ちゃんの舌を満足させられるかな～？", "zh": "唔唔，不错嘛，小{$P$}！\n但是这能满足小茜的味蕾吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2004_p", "source_sha256": "1e855b8621f3fabc31142ab3cb0015f44f0c611b6df29d1ac76fbda6fe16627f", "ja": "どうかな。駅前のケーキ屋さんで買ってきた、\n本格的なやつだけど。", "zh": "不知道呢，不过这是在车站前的蛋糕店买的，\n真材实料的甜点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2005_023aka", "source_sha256": "18bf66610aa20a7a187c3ceb37e7a1531adbe28f9e1ecbb55e73c74aaa02a463", "ja": "なんと！？　さすが茜ちゃんの\n{$P$}ちゃん、有能！", "zh": "真的假的！？不愧是小茜的\n小{$P$}，真能干！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2006_033sih", "source_sha256": "0ad8d521cb6f25f44a0d659eca6053d1cd490dc0ad3104fedb636f5700677bce", "ja": "……はぁ……。", "zh": "……唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2007_p", "source_sha256": "b6b33290232cb6451fa044a2c4797be195e0c6f2e63965135c2b48a2c7ceec1e", "ja": "志保も少し休んだほうがいいぞ。\n水分も補給しないと。", "zh": "志保也休息一下比较好喔，\n也必须补充一下水分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2008_015siz", "source_sha256": "dd34db76925be33382509083d7c7af49e8d77964b27f1e609c55590281554ba7", "ja": "そうですね……それじゃみんな、休憩にしましょう。\nほら、星梨花も。", "zh": "说得没错……那大家先休息吧，\n好了，星梨花也来休息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2009_022ser", "source_sha256": "32ff47a6d77bf59deee2518f56942f58e83c4befe484e2897b3451b026571bff", "ja": "は、はい……ありがとうございます。", "zh": "好、好的……谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2010_033sih", "source_sha256": "12b5f7dfca5d9f5363dc8efe406afabaf735b96799b2708d37d88ffdc6fac904", "ja": "……いいんですか？　こんなことで……。", "zh": "……真的好吗？就因为这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2011_015siz", "source_sha256": "a133f12d0e86a0326bdd73ec9dba6fddf8e4a937f078cb0087b5ab6ceac1c838", "ja": "志保……？", "zh": "志保……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2012_033sih", "source_sha256": "d56ecd15fe60e64fe75975582271a7ca003f28f97e4aedce6386cb7db32171aa", "ja": "休憩なんて、そんな余裕、今の私達にあるんですか？\nただでさえ予定より遅れてるのに……。", "zh": "现在的我们真的有休息的时间吗？\n本来进度就已经落后了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2013_p", "source_sha256": "fb93be3b825ced670562601544eaed8751c6299e7ac89371edeb9f46397a935c", "ja": "まぁまぁ。無理をして続けても、効率が落ちるだけだ。\nそれで、みんながケガでもしたら困るし……。", "zh": "好了好了，就算勉强练下去也不会有效率，\n而且要是大家因此受伤就不好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2014_033sih", "source_sha256": "7f30d39597a0ccd75ad8770f762722c7df1c2440b3fa5a4d00999795985d3edc", "ja": "休憩が悪いとは言いません。でも、お菓子なんて……\n体重管理にも関わるし、練習時間も伸びます。", "zh": "我没有说不该休息，但是吃点心……\n既会影响到体重管理，又会延长练习时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2015_033sih", "source_sha256": "efab4f9f8fefeb2c8250f9ebf693c96e1b36c7e071863ab9d664dcf1b1f593b6", "ja": "レッスン中の雑談も多いし、ムダが多すぎます。\nもっと集中すれば、短時間で終わるのに。", "zh": "练习中也花太多时间闲聊，浪费太多时间了，\n如果大家再专注一点，明明可以在短时间内完成的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2016_015siz", "source_sha256": "b3598b78fd1e283c57f46a0ac1ddf45c13c1be46b598c297a1b0604fdad58ae4", "ja": "それは、そうだけど……。", "zh": "是这样没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2017_p", "source_sha256": "c247afcc492ec13514af348796b61ed4837ea45e123101d7afe582ddde3bf3ba", "ja": "確かに、集中するのは大事だな。\nだからこそ……。", "zh": "集中精神确实是很重要，\n正因如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2018_022ser", "source_sha256": "382977060c18919e29a6c44596aed73b60d7bea95fcc514e22cf75db309975e4", "ja": "あ、あのっ、志保さん！\nごめんなさい、わたし、足を引っ張ってしまって……。", "zh": "那、那个，志保姊姊！\n对不起，是我拖累了大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2019_033sih", "source_sha256": "606851e9d8223fca84dfbe6785223e11670b69c72242edb782db919bc546e1c5", "ja": "別に、星梨花が悪いなんて言ってないわ。\n私は……。", "zh": "我并没有责怪星梨花的意思，\n我是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2020_023aka", "source_sha256": "63f068083bbb499193b869d5d68da713f2d21cf56ebffc1e1ca9508cb70786dc", "ja": "まあまあ、しほりん。昔のエラい人は言いました。\nプリンは冷やしてから食え、と……。", "zh": "好了好了，志保保，从前有个伟人说过，\n布丁要冰过再吃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2021_048rei", "source_sha256": "a5c30b7e7ad3b3b9a322f52a36ae83bfa982deb79ecde7b517ae911a9498c78f", "ja": "うんうん♪　登山もね、絶対無理しちゃダメなんだよ。\nプリンって、富士山に似てるよね♪", "zh": "嗯嗯♪爬山也是一样，绝对不能勉强喔，\n布丁长得跟富士山很像呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2022_033sih", "source_sha256": "fdd3e2fa245262bbbb225396a00c678c62003cb45ba769ce4f360d9ca041575d", "ja": "……今から休憩するなら、\n今日はもう、続きはできそうにないわね。", "zh": "……如果现在要开始休息，\n今天看来是不会再继续练了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2023_033sih", "source_sha256": "e5079c75bca0f04679364de6bf1c58c2149083334dd6ca14150c66d315c08a5e", "ja": "私、帰らせてもらいます。それじゃ。", "zh": "我就先回去了，再见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2024_015siz", "source_sha256": "02d0707a48de4bcf191e8edde0b0d9b971468dd3de8efd16ba251cb41409a08d", "ja": "え！？\nちょ、ちょっと……志保っ！", "zh": "咦！？\n等、等一下……志保！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2025_se", "source_sha256": "172a52394be90cca6467e0a57d29eba5541a0b314af596f3855f7d00b40d23ab", "ja": "パタン", "zh": "磅", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2026_022ser", "source_sha256": "7f5032e7f9235c7e3e28d1d3003deb632d356fee7ac8487aeb5a60c248edc0d2", "ja": "あの、静香さん。わたし達、\n志保さんを怒らせちゃったんでしょうか……？", "zh": "那个，静香姊姊，我们是不是\n惹志保姊姊生气了呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2027_015siz", "source_sha256": "ad9d61f74ce956eeddd9200a71a3ab77f0a8a3ad473bf89e164af973120cfdc9", "ja": "まさか。星梨花のせいじゃないよ。", "zh": "怎么会，这不是星梨花的错喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2028_015siz", "source_sha256": "90a1a5fad381eb5fb0c0f06bf1383eaaff2fa88af5ccbb7d1ae8c36b543324ac", "ja": "でも、確かにちょっと遅れ気味だから……\n明日からは、もっとキッチリ進めていかないと。", "zh": "但感觉进度的确有点落后……\n明天起要更认真赶进度才行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2029_022ser", "source_sha256": "a8566ada785e53e01188ca6848d05ad01783193c4630922a7d65dcbb7c7349cc", "ja": "そうですね。みなさんと一緒だと、楽しくて、\nついおしゃべりしちゃって……。気をつけます。", "zh": "是呀，因为和大家在一起很开心，\n一不小心就开始聊天了……我会多注意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2030_048rei", "source_sha256": "5bc75f08516684ee6e9d936e06161e0269e7ceeced8af0edf374acb6ee600a5e", "ja": "それで、今日はどうしよっか？\n私達も解散？", "zh": "那今天要怎么办？\n我们也要解散了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2031_022ser", "source_sha256": "10e4bde546cbc02267e14436418d34bf3412c9f68634eade974d97dfa4e039c9", "ja": "わ、わたし……もうちょっと残って、練習しますっ。\n今日やったところ、できるようになりたいので……。", "zh": "我、我……想留下来再多练习一下，\n因为想把今天的进度练好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2032_015siz", "source_sha256": "42efddc7f114c48b09a2a220d5d2e022ef2398d89428b29a117198c84c610913", "ja": "私も付き合うわ、星梨花。\n一緒に志保に、いいところを見せましょう！", "zh": "我也陪你一起，星梨花。\n一起让志保刮目相看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2033_022ser", "source_sha256": "5757814aac9e0ced6eae8715e2ed4ac8f254260e7ce3d552f4f33b12b4c2c30b", "ja": "は、はいっ！　頑張ります！", "zh": "好、好的！我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2034_015siz", "source_sha256": "e46d8dec1e0a921a67fd02d7cd4ab130f9504c86c33c1b9b1347680c214c79fa", "ja": "レッスン室、使ってもいいですよね？\n{$P$}。", "zh": "我们可以借用练习室吧？\n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2035_p", "source_sha256": "0ab7a74e6ca811bd3aafcfe74c91ec51fe10cb2ef6a990dca413d9bc7b4f5805", "ja": "もちろん。ただし、あまり遅くなりすぎないようにな。\n明日もレッスンはあるんだから。", "zh": "当然，但不要练到太晚了，\n因为明天还有课程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2036_015siz", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2037_022ser", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2038_023aka", "source_sha256": "d084eb379ea72ebfdc166bdc5110e41175d4423c7849cf5ba0e5e2d07107e9b6", "ja": "もちろん、茜ちゃんも残るよ♪\nモガミンだけに、いいところは持っていかせないよ！", "zh": "小茜当然也要留下来啰♪\n可不能让静香香一个人出尽风头呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2039_048rei", "source_sha256": "b5b883adfcedf8a40f2fe000bd68eceb93c97a703dced6100cb6a255fd1aabf5", "ja": "私も残ろう～っと♪　延長戦、延長戦～。", "zh": "我也要留下来～啰♪延长赛，延长赛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_2040_p", "source_sha256": "c6b0361ae828fe44a94f4ff768b0f749ff2ad5f86297d9065f4a28fb0c2a0a46", "ja": "（志保の気持ちは、どうにかみんなに伝わったらしい。\nこの先も、目が離せないな……！）", "zh": "（看来志保的想法已经传达给大家了，\n接下来的发展也不能错过呢……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "b32de415989c263e1f49efecc357447573ee88d46dbd963cf56eaeb4a6422130", "ja": "すれ違う想い", "zh": "分歧的想法", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "754957afe32d23a340dc24f424ecfeb706ff4648af8707149203ca32a663518d", "ja": "クレシェンドブルーの結成から一週間。\nレッスンの足並みが…なかなか揃わない。\n予定より遅れていることに焦りを感じた志保\nの言葉に発奮し、メンバーは遅れを取り戻そ\nうと居残りレッスンを続けることに。", "zh": "「Crescendo Blue」正式成军后一周，成员们课程\n的步调……不太能统一。志保因进度不如预期\n而感到焦躁，成员们在听了志保的话开始奋发图强，\n为了拉回进度而决定留下来继续练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
